cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "dynamic-model-router: A Cascade Classifier for Cost-Efficient LLM Routing"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Manthan
    family-names: Vaghela
    email: manthansinhvaghela@gmail.com
    # Add your real ORCID iD here once registered: https://orcid.org/register
abstract: >-
  A 3-layer cascade classifier (keyword heuristics, frozen-encoder ML head,
  LLM fallback) that routes each task to the cheapest model that can handle
  it well — before the agent makes an API call. Achieves 60–80% cost
  reduction on production workloads with no measurable quality loss across
  11 popular Python agent frameworks (LangChain, CrewAI, AutoGen, LlamaIndex,
  Pydantic AI, DSPy, Haystack, Semantic Kernel, smolagents, OpenAI Agents
  SDK, Google ADK).
